Step 2 Power Query 

This folder contains the completed Excel Power Query workbook and the exported CSV files for Step 2. The analysis uses the variance CSV files generated in Step 1.

Power Query Analysis includes:

Top 3 Dollar Variances, Top 3 Percentage Variances, Materiality Flag, Monthly Variance Analysis, and Trend Classification.

Trend Classification: A variance was classified as a persistent trend if it occurred in the same direction in at least 4 of the 7 months. 4 months was used because it represents the majority of the period. 

All 6 categories were classified as persistent trends based on the monthly data. 
